        "desc": "<ul>\n  <li><strong>Latest Project 2024 Edition:</strong> Microsoft's premier project management software with enhanced scheduling tools.</li>\n  <li><strong>Retail & Bind Key Options:</strong> Choose between 1 PC Retail Key or Microsoft Account-linked transferable Bind Key.</li>\n  <li><strong>Advanced Resource Management:</strong> Built-in Gantt charts, sprint planning, task dependencies, and resource leveling.</li>\n  <li><strong>Office 365 & Teams Integration:</strong> Effortless project sharing, status reporting, and enterprise collaboration.</li>\n  <li><strong>Instant Digital Delivery:</strong> 100% genuine license delivered immediately with step-by-step setup guidance.</li>\n</ul>",
